  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN City Skoletjenesten/YOUNG</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skoletjenesten/YOUNG is a project under the UN City Copenhagen aimed at raising public awareness of development issues and results related to the United Nations.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to formulate a long-term strategy for the UN City service for public awareness raising of development co-operation efforts, needs and issues (Skoletjenesten/YOUNG) based on a participatory process with key stakeholders.  The resulting strategy shall guide the implementation of Skoletjenesten/YOUNG activities from 2026-2036. 360 case no: 25/06217</narrative>
  </description>
